        "last reduction tap only",
        "input channel 0 at first valid point of first output receptive field",
        "last input channel at last valid point of final output receptive field",
        "kernel center tap at first output point when kernel is odd, otherwise first tap",
        "kernel center tap at last output point when kernel is odd, otherwise last tap",
        "output channel 0 at output coordinate 0,0",
        "last output channel at final output coordinate",
        "bias-only with zero activations",
